{"scene_description":"The image depicts an indoor space, likely a modern library or bookstore. The focal point is a large, cylindrical bookshelf structure in the center of the room, illuminated from within and containing multiple levels of books. The floor appears to be made of polished stone, reflecting light and adding to the bright atmosphere. Large windows on one side allow natural light to flood the space, creating a contrast with the darker interior. There are several tables and chairs arranged around the room, some occupied by people who seem to be reading or working. A few potted plants are placed strategically throughout the space, adding a touch of greenery. The overall design is sleek and contemporary, with clean lines and minimalistic furniture. The lighting is bright and even, enhancing the visibility of the objects and creating a welcoming environment for visitors."}

